{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"a4811153-9640-42bd-b151-edae2fd6a43a","status":"SUCCESS","response":"All four modules have been updated and verified against the BENCH-008 public contract and invariants:\n\n### Summary of Changes\n1. **[models.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_25496_1795168329093_icm/models.py)**:\n   - Implemented `validate_transition(from_status, to_status)` enforcing allowed transitions (`PENDING -\u003e {RUNNING, DLQ}`, `RUNNING -\u003e {COMPLETED, PENDING, DLQ, RUNNING}`, and terminal states `COMPLETED`/`DLQ` -\u003e `set()`), raising `InvalidTransitionError` on invalid transitions.\n   - Added `lease_owner` and `lease_expires_at` fields to `Job` with `__post_init__` validation for attempt bounds (`0 \u003c= attempts \u003c= max_attempts`, `max_attempts \u003e= 1`) and lease invariants across `RUNNING` vs. non-running states.\n\n2. **[retry.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_25496_1795168329093_icm/retry.py)**:\n   - Implemented `compute_backoff(attempt, base, cap, rng)` with input validation (`ValueError` on negative or boolean values), overflow-safe exponential capping (`min(cap, base * (2 ** attempt))`), and deterministic full-jitter sampling via `rng.uniform(0.0, upper)`.\n\n3. **[queue_store.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_25496_1795168329093_icm/queue_store.py)**:\n   - Enabled manual transaction control (`isolation_level=None`) with `BEGIN IMMEDIATE` and automatic `ROLLBACK` on error.\n   - Made `claim_next_job` atomically reclaim expired leases and claim at most one ready `PENDING` job (`available_at \u003c= now` and `attempts \u003c max_attempts`), recording `\"CLAIMED\"` in `job_audit_log`.\n   - Made `complete_job` verify active `RUNNING` status and `lease_owner == worker_id` (raising `LeaseError` otherwise), run `pre_status_hook()` inside the transaction, clear lease fields, and commit atomically (rolling back any partial audit rows on failure).\n   - Implemented `fail_job` and `reclaim_expired_leases` to transition jobs to `DLQ` (`\"DEAD_LETTERED\"`) when `attempts \u003e= max_attempts` or back to `PENDING` (`\"RETRY_SCHEDULED\"` / `\"LEASE_EXPIRED\"`) while clearing lease ownership.\n\n4. **[worker.py](file:///C:/Users/jayde/.gemini/AI-Lab/tmp/disposable_workspaces/live_BENCH-008_25496_1795168329093_icm/worker.py)**:\n   - Updated `WorkerPool.process_one` to catch handler exceptions, compute seeded jittered backoff via `compute_backoff`, and invoke `store.fail_job(...)` without leaking `\"COMPLETED\"` audit rows.\n   - Updated `WorkerPool.run_until_empty` to wait for scheduled retries and reclaim expired leases when `wait_for_retry=True` until no claimable or running jobs remain.\n","duration_seconds":140.1004827,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":46444,"output_tokens":10734,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":136099,"total_tokens":57178}}}
